# DroneCAN sensors: PM08-CAN power module (node 124, CAN2) and the L10D pitot (node 125, CAN1). The battery topic
# source must be external; SLA_PWR_SRC above matches the source the module reports. Reboot after loading.
1	1	UAVCAN_ENABLE	2	6
1	1	UAVCAN_SUB_BAT	2	6
1	1	BAT1_SOURCE	1	6
# Pack capacity for the remaining-charge estimate (2026-11-25: 2200 mAh; the board had 1300 from the old packs, which would raise a
# low-battery warning, and drop SLAAPS power-ready, well before the real pack is low). Cells stay 10 (BAT1_N_CELLS).
1	1	BAT1_CAPACITY	2200	9
1	1	UAVCAN_SUB_DPRES	1	6
# No auto-disarm for a vehicle that has not taken off (lead, 2026-11-17): the wind tunnel run is armed and held, never launched.
# A negative value disables it; the 10 s default disarmed every armed Manual run on the bench.
1	1	COM_DISARM_PRFLT	-1	9
# The airspeed_selector module is not started on this airframe, so the stock 'No airspeed data' arming check must stay off.
# QGC airspeed setup can raise this; SLAAPS reads the raw airspeed topic itself.
1	1	SYS_HAS_NUM_ASPD	0	6
